fr:mainmatter.fr:p:
A subobject \phi  : d \hookrightarrow  c induces a unique characteristic morphism p_{\phi } : c \to  \Omega  such that
  p_{\phi } \circ  \phi  = \mathsf {true} \circ  !_{d}
  Moreover, the appropriate square must be a pullback, but I cannot currently include tikzcd in Forester, which stinks.

